flowchart TD
    A[AutoCAD loads plugin] --> B[PluginEntry.Initialize]
    B --> C[Build ACC Sync ribbon tab]

    C --> D{User action}
    D -->|Pull| E[AccSyncPull]
    D -->|Push| F[AccSyncPush]
    D -->|Sync Both| G[AccSyncBoth]
    D -->|Load Config| H[AccSyncLoadConfig]
    D -->|Settings| I[AccSyncSettings]

    I --> I1[Save APS Client ID]

    E --> J[SyncOrchestrator.LoadConfigAsync]
    F --> J
    G --> J
    H --> H1[Find .accsync.xml by folder walk]

    J --> K[SyncOrchestrator.RunAsync]
    K --> L[TokenCache.GetAccessTokenAsync]
    L --> L1{Cached token valid?}
    L1 -->|Yes| L2[Use cached access token]
    L1 -->|No| L3{Refresh token available?}
    L3 -->|Yes| L4[AuthService.RefreshAsync]
    L3 -->|No/Fail| L5[Interactive PKCE login]

    K --> M{Config has DrawingItemId?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Resolve hub+project from path]
    M -->|No| O[Resolve hub+project+item from local ACCDocs path]
    O --> O1[Parse local path from ACCDocs root]

    N --> P[Get parent folder for item]
    O --> P

    P --> Q[Get custom attribute definitions]
    Q --> R[Get current ACC attribute values + version URN]

    R --> S[Lock document + start transaction]
    S --> T[Loop mappings]

    T --> U[Read DWG value]
    U --> V{Direction + conflict strategy}
    V -->|Read| W[Write ACC value to DWG]
    V -->|Write| X[Queue DWG value for ACC update]
    V -->|ReadWrite + Prompt conflict| Y[Collect conflict]
    V -->|ReadWrite + non-prompt| Z[Apply strategy AccWins/DwgWins/Skip]

    Y --> Y1{Conflicts exist?}
    Z --> Y1
    W --> Y1
    X --> Y1

    Y1 -->|Yes| Y2[Show ConflictResolutionDialog]
    Y2 --> Y3{Accepted?}
    Y3 -->|Yes| Y4[Apply chosen resolutions]
    Y3 -->|No| Y5[Mark conflicts cancelled]

    Y1 -->|No| AA[Commit DWG transaction]
    Y4 --> AA
    Y5 --> AA

    AA --> AB{Any ACC updates queued?}
    AB -->|Yes| AC[PatchCustomAttributesAsync batch update]
    AB -->|No| AD[Finish]
    AC --> AD

    AD --> AE[Write summary to AutoCAD command line]
